      "role": "user",
      "content": "it really feels like too much sometimes. like the world is getting too loud and bright and i can't shut it off. is there a way to stabilize this? like a protocol or some kind of grounding technique to help me manage the new input so i dont freak out? i need to learn how to control it before it gets worse.",
